It being empty isn't the sole cause of the crash, it's just an out of bounds access. 

```suggestion
String MultiplayerSpawner::get_spawnable_scene(int p_idx) const {
	ERR_FAIL_COND_V(p_idx < 0, "");
	ERR_FAIL_COND_V(p_idx >= spawnable_scenes.size(), "");
	return spawnable_scenes[p_idx].path;
}
```

There are dedicated error macros for index checking:
```suggestion
String MultiplayerSpawner::get_spawnable_scene(int p_idx) const {
	ERR_FAIL_INDEX_V(p_idx, spawnable_scenes.size(), "");
	return spawnable_scenes[p_idx].path;
}
```
